### colocar user 1 no grupo 1

POST http://localhost:8080/cotas/comprar
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "usuarioId": 2,
  "grupoId": 1
}

### sorteia
POST http://localhost:8080/assembleia/grupos/1/sortear
Content-Type: application/json



###cria outro
POST http://localhost:8080/grupos/iniciar/1
Content-Type: application/json


### busca 1 usuario
GET http://localhost:8080/usuarios/2
Content-Type: application/json

### lista todos os usuarios
GET http://localhost:8080/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json

### busca 1 usuario
PATCH http://localhost:8080/usuarios/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Gabriel Arcanjo Santos de Camargo"
}

### Buscar todos os grupos
GET http://localhost:8080/grupos?status=EM_ANDAMENTO
Content-Type: application/json


### Buscar um grupos
GET http://localhost:8080/grupos/1
Content-Type: application/json

### Buscar cotas por grupo
GET http://localhost:8080/grupos/1/cotas
Content-Type: application/json


